    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foul beasts of the night haunt your realm. Shoot, loot, and survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Shoot</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a weapon and stick to it, upgrade your weapon as you progress to survive endless hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Loot</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select an Item every time you level-up. Unlock chests with keys for additional Item rewards and upgrade your weapon of choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no limits to the number of items or weapon upgrades, break the game if you wish to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>What to Expect</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-contained single player experience: no micro-transactions, play offline anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run lasts between 10 to 20 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize each run with Runes that suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foul beasts of the night haunt your realm. Shoot, loot, and survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Shoot</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a weapon and stick to it, upgrade your weapon as you progress to survive endless hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Loot</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select an Item every time you level-up. Unlock chests with keys for additional Item rewards and upgrade your weapon of choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no limits to the number of items or weapon upgrades, break the game if you wish to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>What to Expect</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-contained single player experience: no micro-transactions, play offline anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run lasts between 10 to 20 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize each run with Runes that suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul>",
